The '''Wardens Sword''' is a {{Rare}} [[sword]].

The Wardens Sword is decent for early grinding, due to big range and low [[mastery]] requirements. It is recommended to swap it as soon as possible after entering the [[Second Sea]].

==Obtainment==
The Wardens Sword can be obtained by defeating the [[Warden]] with a drop chance between 5% and 10%, who is located in [[Prison]], [[First Sea]].

